G4 is a control loop around Harness², with a meta-strategy archive adapted from HyperAgents.

third_party/harness2 is an unmodified checkout of
https://github.com/google-research/harness2 at commit
6868817518876de8fd170c6a8354daca273b6191
and remains under the Apache License 2.0. Its license is in
third_party/harness2/LICENSE.

third_party/hyperagents/selection.py is adapted from
https://github.com/facebookresearch/HyperAgents at commit
59a68f672dfb92c74aeb7e61535d776fb36e172d
(utils/gl_utils.py select_parent method score_child_prop, and
filter_patch_by_files). That adaptation is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
Its license is in third_party/hyperagents/LICENSE.md.
